    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Amazia Mfalme Wa Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "r"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "(",
          "type": "text"
        },
        {
          "name": "ref",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "id": "2KI.14.2-2KI.14.20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2 Wafalme 14:2-20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ")",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amazia alikuwa na umri wa miaka ishirini na mitano alipoanza kutawala, naye akatawala huko Yerusalemu kwa miaka ishirini na tisa. Mama yake aliitwa Yehoadani kutoka Yerusalemu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akatenda yaliyo mema machoni pa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.25.2",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.25.2"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": ", lakini sio kwa moyo wake wote.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baada ya ufalme kuimarika mikononi mwake, aliwaua maafisa waliomuua mfalme baba yake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata hivyo hakuwaua watoto wao, lakini akafanya sawasawa na ilivyoandikwa katika Sheria, katika Kitabu cha Mose, ambako",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.25.4",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.25.4"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aliamuru: \"Baba hawatauawa kwa ajili ya watoto wao, wala watoto hawatauawa kwa ajili ya baba zao. Kila mmoja atakufa kwa ajili ya dhambi zake mwenyewe.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amazia akawaita watu wa Yuda pamoja, akawaweka chini ya majemadari wa maelfu na majemadari wa mamia kufuatana na jamaa zao katika Yuda yote na Benyamini. Kisha akawahesabu wale wenye umri wa miaka ishirini au zaidi na akakuta kwamba walikuwa wanaume 300,000 watu walio tayari kwa utumishi wa jeshi, walio na uwezo wa kutumia mkuki na ngao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akawaajiri pia watu 100,000 wapiganaji kutoka Israeli kwa talanta 100 za fedha.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini mtu wa Mungu akamjia na kumwambia, \"Ee mfalme, haya majeshi kutoka Israeli kamwe usiyaruhusu yaende pamoja na wewe kwa kuwa",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.25.7",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.25.7"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "hayuko pamoja na Israeli, wala hayupo pamoja na yeyote wa watu wa Efraimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata kama ukienda na kupigana kwa ujasiri katika vita, Mungu atakufanya ukimbie mbele ya adui, kwa kuwa Mungu anao uwezo wa kusaidia au wa kuangusha.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amazia akamuuliza yule mtu wa Mungu, \"Lakini itakuwaje kwa zile talanta 100 za fedha nilizolipa kwa ajili ya haya majeshi ya Israeli?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2CH 25:9"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yule mtu wa Mungu akajibu, \"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.25.9",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.25.9"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aweza kukupa zaidi sana ya hizo.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo Amazia akayaondoa yale majeshi yaliyokuwa yamekuja kutoka Efraimu na kuyarudisha nyumbani. Waliwakasirikia sana Yuda, nao wakarudi nyumbani wakiwa na hasira kali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo Amazia akajitia nguvu na kuliongoza jeshi lake kwenye Bonde la Chumvi, ambako aliua watu 10,000 wa Seiri.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jeshi la Yuda pia likawateka watu 10,000 wakiwa hai, likawapandisha juu ya jabali na kuwatupa chini kwa nguvu hata wote wakavunjika vipande vipande.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati huo yale majeshi Amazia aliyoyarudisha na ambayo hakuyaruhusu kushiriki katika vita, yalivamia miji ya Yuda kuanzia Samaria hata Beth-Horoni. Yakawaua watu 3,000 na kuchukua kiasi kikubwa sana cha mateka.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amazia aliporudi kutoka kuwachinja Waedomu, alileta pia kutoka huko miungu ya watu wa Seiri. Akaisimamisha kama miungu yake mwenyewe, akaisujudia na kuitolea kafara za kuteketezwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hasira ya",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.25.15",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.25.15"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ikawaka dhidi ya Amazia, naye akamtuma nabii kwake, ambaye alisema: \"Kwa nini unauliza kwa miungu ya hawa watu, ambayo haikuweza kuwaokoa watu wake wenyewe kutoka mkononi mwako?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakati nabii alipokuwa angali anazungumza, mfalme akamwambia, \"Je, wewe tumekuchagua kuwa mshauri wa mfalme? Nyamaza, ya nini uuawe?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p",
        "vid": "2CH 25:16"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Hivyo nabii akanyamaza lakini akasema, \"Najua kuwa Mungu ameazimia kukuangamiza kwa sababu umefanya jambo hili na hukusikiliza shauri langu.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baada ya Amazia mfalme wa Yuda kushauriana na washauri wake akatuma ujumbe kwa Yehoashi, mwana wa Yehoahazi mwana wa Yehu, mfalme wa Israeli kusema: \"Njoo tukabiliane uso kwa uso.\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lakini Yehoashi mfalme wa Israeli akamjibu Amazia mfalme wa Yuda, \"Mbaruti uliokuwa Lebanoni ulituma ujumbe kwa mwerezi uliokuwa Lebanoni, 'Mtoe binti yako aolewe na mwanangu.' Kisha mnyama wa mwituni aliyekuwa Lebanoni akaja na kuukanyaga ule mbaruti.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wewe unasema moyoni mwako kwamba umemshinda Edomu, nawe sasa unajigamba na kujivuna. Lakini kaa nyumbani kwako! Kwa nini utafute matatizo na kujiletea anguko lako mwenyewe na la Yuda pia?\"",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hata hivyo, Amazia hakutaka kusikia, kwa kuwa Mungu alifanya hivyo ili awatie mikononi mwa Yehoashi, kwa sababu waliitafuta miungu ya Edomu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hivyo Yehoashi mfalme wa Israeli akakwea kuwashambulia. Yeye na Amazia mfalme wa Yuda wakakabiliana uso kwa uso huko Beth-Shemeshi katika Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda ikashindwa na Israeli na kila mtu akakimbilia nyumbani kwake.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehoashi mfalme wa Israeli akamteka Amazia mfalme wa Yuda, mwana wa Yoashi, mwana wa Ahazia, huko Beth-Shemeshi. Kisha Yehoashi akamleta Yerusalemu na kuubomoa ukuta wa Yerusalemu kuanzia lango la Efraimu hadi Lango la Pembeni, sehemu yenye urefu wa kama dhiraa 400.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akachukua dhahabu yote, fedha na vyombo vyote vilivyopatikana katika Hekalu la Mungu, ambavyo vilikuwa chini ya uangalizi wa Obed-Edomu, pamoja na hazina za jumba la mfalme na mateka, kisha akarudi Samaria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amazia mwana wa Yoashi mfalme wa Yuda aliishi miaka kumi na mitano baada ya kifo cha Yehoashi mwana wa Yehoahazi mfalme wa Israeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwa habari ya matukio mengine katika utawala wa Amazia, kuanzia mwanzo hadi mwisho, je, hayakuandikwa katika kitabu cha wafalme wa Yuda na wa Israeli?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuanzia wakati ule Amazia alipogeuka na kuacha kumfuata",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "char",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "nd"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Bwana",
              "type": "text",
              "attrs": {
                "verseId": "2CH.25.27",
                "verseOrgIds": [
                  "2CH.25.27"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "walifanya shauri baya dhidi yake huko Yerusalemu naye akakimbilia Lakishi, lakini wakawatuma watu wamfuatilie huko Lakishi nao wakamuulia huko.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 25:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarudishwa kwa farasi na akazikwa pamoja na baba zake katika Mji wa Yuda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.25.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.25.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
